Each constant supplies its own body for a shared step. What does the program print?
enum Op {
    ADD {
        int apply(int a, int b) {
            return a + b;
        }
    },
    MUL {
        int apply(int a, int b) {
            return a * b;
        }
    };

    abstract int apply(int a, int b);
}

class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();
        for (Op o : Op.values()) {
            sb.append(o.apply(3, 4)).append(" ");
        }
        System.out.println(sb.toString().trim());
    }
}
